                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Throughout this lesson, we've explored the diverse yet interconnected roles within the radiation oncology team. Each professional brings unique expertise essential for delivering safe, effective, and compassionate patient care. As a radiation therapist, you are a vital member of this team, requiring not only technical skill but also strong communication and collaboration abilities."
