                      "text": "Anticipate patient needs more effectively."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Communicate more clearly with other team members."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
